    "title": "Former WWE, UFC champion banned from wrestling: 'He's in so much trouble' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Former WWE, UFC champion banned from wrestling: ‘He’s in so much trouble’\nBy Mark Heim,\n4 hours agoBrock Lesnar has been banned from professional wrestling, Daniel Cormier has revealed. Cormier, the former UFC champion, shared the news when appearing on the MightyCast with Demetrious Johnson. Cormier didn’t give specifics but said Lesnar - the former WWE and UFC champ - is in “so much trouble.”\n1",
